:Situation_PRV-001 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Used to warn that having good intentions is not enough if the resulting actions end up causing harm or negative consequences." .

:Situation_PRV-002 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "When someone does something out of good intentions that ultimately ends up harming you." .

:Situation_PRV-003 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "It's used to make someone who is in tough situation to feel better and give them a more positive perspective." .

:Situation_PRV-004 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Used to comfort someone in a difficult situation, giving them hope that things will get better." .

:Situation_PRV-005 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Used as a reminder that solutions can be found in the darkest moments when someone has completely given up." .

:Situation_PRV-006 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "when someone wants to do something objectively difficult, this is used to encourage them to not give up." .

:Situation_PRV-007 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Used to encourage someone who has been working toward a goal for a long time so they don't give up." .

:Situation_PRV-008 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Used to highlight how those who are quiet and reserved are actually quite knowledgeable." .

:Situation_PRV-009 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "A warning about quiet people who hide their plans and can be more dangerous than loud, aggressive ones." .

:Situation_PRV-010 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "To warn people for how they treat others, because should they treat someone poorly, the same thing might happen to them." .

:Situation_PRV-011 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "When someone suffers the exact same bad thing they did to another person, or to encourage good deeds." .

:Situation_PRV-012 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Used to show how the strength of a group depends on every individual's ability" .

:Situation_PRV-013 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "When a project fails because of a small, ignored weakness or a vulnerable member." .

:Situation_PRV-015 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Used to highlight that sometimes people don't act on what they preach." .

:Situation_PRV-016 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "After challenging events, good events await." .

:Situation_PRV-020 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "When someone looks for something, through persevering, they will find it." .

:Situation_PRV-021 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "What is hidden ruins seemingly strong fundations." .

:Situation_PRV-023 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Who acts wrongly/chaoticly will end up getting in exchange the same behavior." .

:Situation_PRV-025 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Things crumble in the steps of a process that are weaker." .

:Situation_PRV-027 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "When someone keeps declaring good intentions but never acts on them." .

:Situation_PRV-028 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "When a well-meaning but foolish friend causes harm through clumsy help." .

:Situation_PRV-029 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Encouraging someone that effort will eventually pay off." .

:Situation_PRV-030 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Reassuring someone that small, steady efforts build a big result." .

:Situation_PRV-031 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Warning that one weak or bad member can damage the whole group." .

:Situation_PRV-032 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Warning to be wary of calm, quiet people who may be the most dangerous." .

:Situation_PRV-033 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Telling someone their actions, good or bad, will come back to them." .

:Situation_PRV-034 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Warning that harm planned for others rebounds on the one who plans it." .

:Situation_PRV-035 a :SituationOfUse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Comforting someone in a hard moment that better days will follow." .

